{"1860490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lords & Blades", "steam_appid": 1860490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover a Dark Mystery in a World of Magic and Danger!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the enchanting yet perilous realm of <strong>Eswaydan</strong>, a valley steeped in mystery and magic, nestled within the cold, majestic peaks of the Thuyr Kingdom. But beware—Eswaydan is cursed. Every five years, a lone hero is summoned from the legendary <strong>Hillside Hut</strong> to confront the dark forces that threaten to engulf the valley.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you be the one to break the cycle and save Eswaydan?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌟 <strong>Engage in an epic RPG adventure</strong> filled with rich storytelling and deep, meaningful choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔍 <strong>Explore a breathtaking world</strong>—from icy mountains to ancient ruins—and uncover the secrets of Eswaydan’s curse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤝 <strong>Embark on epic quests </strong>or explore the world on your terms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of Eswaydan is in your hands. Will you rise to the challenge, or will the valley succumb to eternal darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your adventure begins now.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860490/extras/417607ec9ba15ed121e13ef331d1d92f.poster.avif?t=1738362249\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860490/extras/417607ec9ba15ed121e13ef331d1d92f.webm?t=1738362249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://share